{"ticker":"TXN","updated":"2026-10-30T23:18:45Z","profile":{"longName":"Texas Instruments Incorporated","shortName":"Texas Instruments Incorporated","sector":"Technology","industry":"Semiconductors","country":"United States","website":"https://www.ti.com","fullTimeEmployees":33000,"marketCap":275042271232,"trailingPE":39.019455,"forwardPE":26.108826,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":13.244837,"pegRatio":0.95,"targetMeanPrice":336.86206,"targetHighPrice":400.0,"targetLowPrice":250.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":29,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.277,"earningsGrowth":0.77,"grossMargins":0.60243,"operatingMargins":0.47547,"profitMargins":0.34252998,"totalRevenue":20765999104,"beta":1.339,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":334.03,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":152.73,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.94},"summary":"Texas Instruments Incorporated designs, manufactures, and sells semiconductors to electronics designers and manufacturers in the United States, China, the rest of Asia, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, Japan, and internationally. It operates through Analog and Embedded Processing segments. The Analog segment offers power products to manage power requirements across various voltage levels, including battery-management solutions, DC/DC switching regulators, AC/DC and isolated controllers and converters, power switches, linear regulators, voltage references, multiphase controllers and power stages, and lighting products. This segment also provides signal chain products that sense, condition, and measure real-world signals and convert them into data to be transferred or converted for further processing and control, such as amplifiers, data converters, interface products, motor drives, clocks, and logic and sensing products. The Embedded Processing segment offers microcontrollers, processors, wireless connectivity, and radar products; and applications processors for specific computing activity. It also provides DLP products primarily for use in projecting high-definition images; calculators; and application-specific integrated circuits. Its products are used in various markets, such as industrial, automotive, personal electronics, communications equipment, enterprise systems, calcul","summary_zh":"德州儀器公司 (TI) 為美國、中國、亞洲其他地區、歐洲、中東、非洲、日本和國際各地的電子設計師和製造商設計、製造和銷售半導體。它透過模擬和嵌入式處理部門運作。類比部門提供電源產品來管理各種電壓等級的電源需求，包括電池管理解決方案、DC/DC開關穩壓器、AC/DC和隔離控制器和轉換器、電源開關、線性穩壓器、基準電壓源、多相控制器和功率等級以及照明產品。該部門還提供訊號鏈產品，用於感測、調節和測量現實世界的訊號，並將其轉換為要傳輸或轉換的資料以進行進一步處理和控制，例如放大器、資料轉換器、介面產品、馬達驅動器、時脈以及邏輯和感測產品。嵌入式處理部門提供微控制器、處理器、無線連接和雷達產品；以及用於特定運算活動的應用處理器。它還提供主要用於投影高清影像的DLP產品；計算器；和專用積體電路。其產品應用於各種市場，如工業、汽車、個人電子、通訊設備、企業系統、運算","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"半導體","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":199.38,"h":200.17,"l":196.76,"c":199.81,"v":6238400},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":199.22,"h":200.08,"l":191.38,"c":195.74,"v":7039600},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":183.76,"h":188.68,"l":181.69,"c":187.29,"v":11335900},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":187.08,"h":189.28,"l":185.29,"c":187.93,"v":9491200},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":188.15,"h":188.37,"l":183.07,"c":185.82,"v":9701200},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":184.4,"h":185.66,"l":183.66,"c":185.03,"v":6135000},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":185.04,"h":185.49,"l":182.94,"c":184.01,"v":5957500},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":184.51,"h":184.81,"l":182.26,"c":184.35,"v":6596000},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":184.11,"h":184.34,"l":182.34,"c":182.6,"v":6284200},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":175.88,"h":179.22,"l":174.01,"c":178.2,"v":11658400},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":178.74,"h":181.14,"l":177.28,"c":177.63,"v":7920300},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":177.84,"h":182.57,"l":177.61,"c":180.3,"v":7209700},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":183.24,"h":183.72,"l":180.31,"c":181.62,"v":7937100},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":182.59,"h":183.25,"l":178.17,"c":179.37,"v":16206700},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":179.4,"h":181.41,"l":179.31,"c":179.62,"v":7030300},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":179.87,"h":182.67,"l":179.68,"c":182.04,"v":5900800},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":181.72,"h":185.16,"l":181.1,"c":184.44,"v":5905100},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":183.65,"h":183.66,"