s.de","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-27","zh":"德州儀器 (TI) 定價 20 億美元票據，德州儀器 (TI) 股票交易價格為 266.80 歐元 - ad-hoc-news.de"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":3},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":2},{"name":"併購","count":2},{"name":"半導體/晶片","count":1},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-06","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/97476/000009747626000059/txn-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"We design and manufacture semiconductors that we sell to electronics designers and manufacturers all over the world. Our operations began in 1930, and we are incorporated in Delaware. With headquarters in Dallas, Texas, we have design, manufacturing or sales operations in more than 30 countries. Our two reportable segments are Analog and Embedded Processing, and we report the results of our remaining business activities in Other. In 2025, we generated $17.68 billion of revenue.","zh":"我們設計和製造半導體，並將其銷售給世界各地的電子設計師和製造商。我們於 1930 年開始運營，並在特拉華州註冊成立。我們的總部位於德州達拉斯，在 30 多個國家設有設計、製造或銷售業務。我們的兩個可報告部門是模擬和嵌入式處理部門，我們在其他部門報告剩餘業務活動的結果。 2025 年，我們創造了 176.8 億美元的收入。"},{"en":"For decades, we have operated with a passion to create a better world by making electronics more affordable through semiconductors. We were pioneers in the transition from vacuum tubes to transistors and then to integrated circuits. As each generation has become more reliable, more affordable and lower in power, semiconductors are used by a growing number of customers and markets. Our passion continues to be alive today as we help our customers develop electronics and new applications.","zh":"幾十年來，我們一直熱衷於透過半導體讓電子產品變得更便宜，從而創造一個更美好的世界。我們是從真空管到電晶體再到積體電路過渡的先驅。隨著每一代產品變得更加可靠、更實惠且功耗更低，半導體被越來越多的客戶和市場所使用。時至今日，我們仍然充滿熱情，幫助客戶開發電子產品和新應用。"},{"en":"For many years, we have run our business with three overarching ambitions in mind. First, we will act like owners who will own the company for decades. Second, we will adapt and succeed in a world that is ever changing. And third, we will be a company that we are personally proud to be a part of and that we would want as our neighbor. Our ambitions are foundational to ensuring that we operate in a sustainable and environmentally responsible manner. When we are successful in achieving these ambitions, our employees, customers, communities and shareholders all win.","zh":"多年來，我們在經營業務時牢記三個首要目標。首先，我們將像擁有公司數十年的所有者一樣行事。其次，我們將適應不斷變化的世界並取得成功。第三，我們將成為一家讓我們個人感到自豪並希望成為我們鄰居的公司。我們的雄心壯志是確保我們以可持續和對環境負責的方式運作的基礎。當我們成功實現這些目標時，我們的員工、客戶、社區和股東都會受益。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"We market and sell our products through direct sales channels, including our website and broad sales and marketing team, and, to a lesser extent, through distributors. Over the past several years, we have been investing in new capabilities to build closer direct customer relationships. In 2025, more than 80% of our revenue was direct, which includes TI.com. Our investments in new and improved capabilities to directly support our customers include order fulfillment services, inventory programs, business processes and logistics and website and e-commerce capabilities. Closer direct relationships with our customers help to strengthen our reach of market channel advantage and give us access to more customers and more of their design projects, leading to opportunities to sell more of our products into each design. Additionally, broader and deeper access gives us better insight and knowledge o","zh":"我們透過直接銷售管道（包括我們的網站和廣泛的銷售和行銷團隊）行銷和銷售我們的產品，並在較小程度上透過經銷商。在過去的幾年裡，我們一直在投資新功能，以建立更緊密的直接客戶關係。到 2025 年，我們超過 80% 的收入來自直接收入，其中包括 TI.com。我們對新的和改進的能力進行投資，以直接支援我們的客戶，包括訂單履行服務、庫存計劃、業務流程和物流以及網站和電子商務能力。與客戶建立更緊密的直接關係有助於加強我們的市場通路優勢，並使我們能夠接觸到更多的客戶和他們的設計項目，從而有機會在每個設計中銷售更多的產品。此外，更廣泛和更深入的訪問使我們能夠更好地洞察和了解"}],"competition":[{"en":"Despite consolidation, the analog and embedded processing markets remain highly fragmented. As a result, we face significant global competition from dozens of large and small companies, including both broad-based suppliers and niche suppliers. Our competitors also include emerging companies, particularly in Asia.","zh":"儘管進行了一致，模擬和嵌入式處理市場仍然高度分散。因此，我們面臨著來自數十家大大小小的公司的激烈全球競爭，其中包括廣泛的供應商和利基供應商。我們的競爭對手也包括新興公司，尤其是亞洲的新興公司。"},{"en":"We believe that competitive performance in the semiconductor market generally depends on many factors, including the breadth of a company's product line, the strength and reach of its channels to market, technological innovation, product development execution, technical support, customer service, quality, reliability, price, and manufacturing capacity and capabilities, such as process and package technologies that provide differentiated levels of performance and a structural cost advantage. In addition, customers' prior investments in software development is also a competitive factor for our embedded processing products.","zh":"我們認為，半導體市場的競爭表現通常取決於許多因素，包括公司產品線的廣度、市場管道的實力和覆蓋範圍、技術創新、產品開發執行、技術支援、客戶服務、品質、可靠性、價格以及製造能力和能力，例如提供差異化性能水平和結構性成本優勢的製程和封裝技術。此外，客戶在軟體開發方面的前期投資也是我們嵌入式處理產品的競爭因素。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Analog","val":14006000000,"zh":"模擬"},{"name":"Embedded Processing","val":2697000000,"zh":"嵌入式處理"},{"name":"All Other Segments","val":979000000,"zh":"所有其他部門"}],"total":17682000000}},"peers":["AMAT","ADI","QCOM","LRCX","KLAC"]}}